From 3ef8b33f76a37b8d0eafb5afce6abc9dc5655ff1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:06:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/52] fix-sec-3: V12 residual: read-only checkouts keep no
 token; idb pinned in the iOS Simulator job

- persist-credentials: false on all 16 checkouts of jobs that do not push with the checkout's token
  (ci, pages build, snapshot x4, bigtech-probe, the probes, the refresh jobs of monthly-refresh and
  col-refresh, webkit-phone x3). The four pushers (archive-ingest x2, persist-ledger x2) keep theirs.
  Their remaining git fetches are anonymous reads of this public repository.
- webkit-phone.yml: the facebook/fb tap is checked out at 1fabba2a (its formula installs idb-companion
  v1.7.6 from the release tarball, sha256 pinned in the formula) with HOMEBREW_NO_AUTO_UPDATE; fb-idb
  1.7.6 and the 7 dependencies run 38979700118 installed come from .github/scripts/idb-requirements.txt
  with --require-hashes --only-binary :all: (resolved with pip download for macOS arm64, Python 3.14).
Tests: "V12 residual" un-todo'd and widened to every workflow; a new test pins the idb install.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
